abstract: >
  End-to-end supply chain analytics case study built on the DataCo SMART Supply
  Chain dataset: data inspection and cleaning, KPI engineering, an Excel
  analytics workbook, a documented Power BI data model with DAX measures, an
  interactive dependency-free HTML dashboard, and evidence-backed business
  findings.
